  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU-China Dialogue on Migration and Mobility Support Project &#x2013; Phase III (MMSP III)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of MMSP III is to strengthen the EU-China Migration and Mobility Dialogue by addressing migration as a global challenge. To achieve this goal, the project aims to address the practical needs of all parties concerned and to enhance their cooperation on migration and mobility between the EU and China.</narrative>
  </description>
